&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;Harness is the AI Software Delivery Platform company, led by technologist and entrepreneur Jyoti Bansal (founder of AppDynamics, acquired by Cisco for $3.7B). Harness has raised approximately $570M in funding and is valued at $5.5B, backed by leading investors including Goldman Sachs, Menlo Ventures, IVP, Unusual Ventures, Citi Ventures, and more. As AI accelerates code creation, the real bottleneck has shifted to everything after the code – testing, deployments, application security, reliability, compliance, and cost optimization. Harness brings AI and automation to this “outer loop,” helping teams ship software faster while maintaining security and governance throughout the entire software delivery lifecycle.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Powered by Harness AI and the Software Delivery Knowledge Graph, the Harness Platform applies deep context and intelligent automation across the software delivery lifecycle with governance and policy-driven controls embedded throughout the platform.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Over the past year, Harness powered over 185M deployments, 82M builds, 18T flag evaluations, 8M security scans, 9.1B optimized tests, 3T protected API calls, and helped manage $2.8B in cloud spend — enabling customers like United Airlines, Morningstar, and Choice Hotels to accelerate releases by up to 75%, reduce cloud costs by up to 60%, and achieve 10x DevOps efficiency.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;With a global team across 26 offices and 27 countries, Harness is shaping the future of AI software delivery — and we’re looking for exceptional talent to help us move even faster.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div id=&quot;message-list_1793033919.742299&quot;&gt;
&lt;div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;At Harness, we&#39;re excited to welcome a Senior Engineer to the Coverage team, where you’ll play a central role in evolving the developer experience around code coverage and code quality. This is an opportunity to work on a high-impact product used by hundreds to thousands of engineering teams to ship higher-quality code, faster.&lt;br&gt;As a Senior Engineer on the Coverage team, you&#39;ll take ownership of critical areas of the Harness Code Coverage product suite, including:&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;New and growing Coverage platform&lt;/strong&gt;, which helps teams identify and prioritize coverage needs&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Report ingestion and processing which powers code coverage and quality insights&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Interactive dashboards&lt;/strong&gt; that brings insights to life&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&lt;br&gt;You’ll collaborate across product, design, and engineering teams to build seamless, performant, and intuitive user experiences. Whether you’re designing a new coverage feature or improving scalability and resilience in processing, you’ll be empowered to own the full stack and shape the future of how teams test and ship code.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong&gt;In this role you will&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead development across both frontend and backend systems of the Coverage product&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own the architecture and implementation of key features in our coverage platform&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Improve developer workflows through integrations into other SCMs and CIs&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Author software functional specifications and design documents&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Champion performance, scalability, and reliability across the stack&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner closely with design, product, and other engineering teams to turn ideas into working software&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Embrace the challenge of a fast-paced and ever-evolving tech landscape, where your adaptability and problem-solving skills will be your greatest assets.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Qualifications&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;4+ years of experience required.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Previous contributions as part of a high-performing software engineering organization.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience designing, extending, and maintaining high volume mission critical systems used by hundreds of thousands of end users.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with Go and PostgreSQL is preferred, but not required.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with React or similar is nice to have, but also not required.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong communication and collaboration skills, with the ability to articulate technical concepts to both technical and non-technical stakeholders.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
